 </span><span begin="01:02.100" end="01:02.310">to </span><span begin="01:02.310" end="01:03.390">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.420" end="01:07.290"><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:03.990">But </span><span begin="01:03.990" end="01:04.440">the </span><span begin="01:04.440" end="01:05.100">party </span><span begin="01:05.100" end="01:05.220">ain't </span><span begin="01:05.220" end="01:05.340">the </span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.940">same </span><span begin="01:05.940" end="01:06.690">without </span><span begin="01:06.690" end="01:07.290">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.350" end="01:10.740"><span begin="01:07.350" end="01:07.650">That's </span><span begin="01:07.650" end="01:07.830">why </span><span begin="01:07.830" end="01:08.040">you're </span><span begin="01:08.040" end="01:08.310">so </span><span begin="01:08.310" end="01:08.820">good </span><span begin="01:08.820" end="01:09.300">for </span><span begin="01:09.300" end="01:10.320">everybody </span><span begin="01:10.320" end="01:10.740">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.740" end="01:12.210"><span begin="01:10.740" end="01:10.980">But </span><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:11.100">you're </span><span begin="01:11.100" end="01:11.640">trouble </span><span begin="01:11.640" end="01:11.880">for </span><span begin="01:11.880" end="01:12.210">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.210" end="01:14.190"><span begin="01:12.210" end="01:12.705">Oh </span><span begin="01:12.705" end="01:13.200">oh </span><span begin="01:13.200" end="01:13.695">oh </span><span begin="01:13.695" end="01:14.190">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.430" end="01:16.530"><span begin="01:14.430" end="01:14.730">Yeah</span><span begin="01:14.730" end="01:14.730">, </span><span begin="01:14.730" end="01:14.940">you're </span><span begin="01:14.940" end="01:15.450">trouble </span><span begin="01:15.450" end="01:15.690">for </span><span begin="01:15.690" end="01:16.530">me</span></p><p tt